  m_Name: 004-nehanda
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  characterName: Nehanda Mbizi
  promptText: "Corporate GMO seeds have blown into our fields. Burning them stops
    the contamination but costs us this year\u2019s harvest. Keeping them puts our
    seed stock and our food sovereignty at risk. Do I sacrifice this year\u2019s
    food, or our seeds\u2019 future?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, burn them; protect your seed stock, even if this year is hungry.
  rightAnswer: No, keep the crop; feed people now and manage the long-term risk.
